### Equipe — Usuários, Grupos, Permissões, Load Balance (F08 Step 6)
### Requer cookie JWT válido — faça login primeiro (POST /login) e o token será salvo automaticamente.

@base_url = http://localhost:8080
@token = YOUR_JWT_HERE
@userId = REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID
@groupId = REPLACE_WITH_GROUP_ID
@funnelId = REPLACE_WITH_FUNNEL_ID
@inviteId = REPLACE_WITH_INVITE_ID

###
### ============= USUÁRIOS (Users tab) =============
###

### Listar usuários do tenant (JSON API)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Página de usuários (HTMX + HTML)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/team/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Tabela de usuários (fragmento HTMX)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/team/users/table
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Modal de permissões do usuário
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/team/users/{{userId}}/permissions-modal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Salvar permissões do usuário (form POST)
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/team/users/{{userId}}/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

perms=leads:read&perms=leads:create&perms=leads:update

###

### Modal de WhatsApp do usuário
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/team/users/{{userId}}/whatsapp-modal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Salvar WhatsApp do usuário
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/team/users/{{userId}}/whatsapp
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

whatsapp_id=5511999999999

###

### Remover usuário do tenant (JSON API)
DELETE {{base_url}}/tenant/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### ============= CONVITES (Invites) =============
###

### Modal para criar convite
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/team/invites/new-modal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Listar convites do tenant (JSON API)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/invites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Criar convite (form POST)
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/team/invites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

group_ids={{groupId}}&expires_in_days=7

###

### Revogar convite (JSON API)
DELETE {{base_url}}/tenant/invites/{{inviteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Aceitar convite (público, sem autenticação)
POST {{base_url}}/invite/{{inviteToken}}/accept
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

password=nova_senha_123

###
### ============= GRUPOS DE PERMISSÃO =============
###

### Página de grupos (HTMX + HTML)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/team/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Tabela de grupos (fragmento HTMX)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/team/groups/table
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Modal para criar novo grupo
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/team/groups/new-modal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Criar grupo (form POST)
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/team/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=Vendas&description=Equipe comercial

###

### Listar grupos (JSON API)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Obter grupo (JSON API)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/groups/{{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Atualizar grupo (JSON API)
PUT {{base_url}}/tenant/groups/{{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Vendas Senior",
  "description": "Equipe comercial senior"
}

###

### Deletar grupo (JSON API)
DELETE {{base_url}}/tenant/groups/{{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### ============= DETALHE DO GRUPO (5 seções) =============
###

### Página de detalhe do grupo
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/team/groups/{{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Seção: Membros
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/team/groups/{{groupId}}/section/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Adicionar membro ao grupo (JSON API)
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/groups/{{groupId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{userId}}"
}

###

### Remover membro do grupo (JSON API)
DELETE {{base_url}}/tenant/groups/{{groupId}}/members/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Seção: Permissões
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/team/groups/{{groupId}}/section/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Salvar permissões do grupo (form POST)
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/team/groups/{{groupId}}/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

perms=leads:read&perms=leads:create&perms=groups:manage&perms=funnels:read

###

### Obter permissões do grupo (JSON API)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/groups/{{groupId}}/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Salvar permissões do grupo (JSON API)
PUT {{base_url}}/tenant/groups/{{groupId}}/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "permissions": ["leads:read", "leads:create", "groups:manage", "funnels:read"]
}

###

### Seção: Funis
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/team/groups/{{groupId}}/section/funnels
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Salvar funis do grupo (form POST)
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/team/groups/{{groupId}}/funnels
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

funnel_ids={{funnelId}}

###

### Obter funis do grupo (JSON API)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/groups/{{groupId}}/funnels
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Salvar funis do grupo (JSON API)
PUT {{base_url}}/tenant/groups/{{groupId}}/funnels
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "funnel_ids": ["{{funnelId}}"]
}

###

### Seção: Perfis de Visualização
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/team/groups/{{groupId}}/section/view-profiles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Salvar perfil de visualização para um funil (form POST)
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/team/groups/{{groupId}}/view-profiles/{{funnelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

visible_columns=col-1&visible_columns=col-2&visible_columns=col-3

###

### Obter perfis de visualização do grupo (JSON API)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/groups/{{groupId}}/view-profiles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Salvar perfil de visualização (JSON API)
PUT {{base_url}}/tenant/groups/{{groupId}}/view-profiles/{{funnelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "visible_columns": ["col-1", "col-2", "col-3"]
}

###

### Seção: Load Balance
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/team/groups/{{groupId}}/section/load-balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Salvar configuração de load balance (form POST — HTML)
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/team/groups/{{groupId}}/load-balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

algorithm=round_robin&active=true

###

### Obter configuração de load balance (JSON API)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/groups/{{groupId}}/load-balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Salvar configuração de load balance (JSON API)
PUT {{base_url}}/tenant/groups/{{groupId}}/load-balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "algorithm": "round_robin",
  "active": true
}

###
### ============= EXEMPLO: Fluxo completo =============
###

### 1. Login (salva automaticamente token no cookie)
POST {{base_url}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email=usuario@tenant.com&password=senha123

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

###

### 2. Listar usuários
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/team/users
Cookie: token={{token}}

###

### 3. Listar grupos
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/team/groups
Cookie: token={{token}}

###

### 4. Criar novo grupo
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/team/groups
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=Suporte&description=Equipe de suporte ao cliente

###

### 5. Acessar detalhe do grupo (substituir {{groupId}})
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/team/groups/{{groupId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

###

### 6. Configurar permissões do grupo
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/team/groups/{{groupId}}/permissions
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

perms=leads:read&perms=leads:update&perms=products:manage

###

### 7. Configurar load balance
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/team/groups/{{groupId}}/load-balance
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

algorithm=round_robin&active=true
